        "content": "## B2B Vehicle Data Sync\nThis workflow demonstrates a B2B automation use case: fetching vehicle fitment directory data from [BoltPatternHQ](https://boltpatternhq.com/), limiting the results, formatting the fields, and automatically pushing them into a Google Sheet for inventory or CRM synchronization.\n\n### Requirements\n- A Google account to connect the Google Sheets node.\n- A target Google Sheet with columns matching `VehicleName` and `ProfileURL`."
